                        "sense_id": "688a644e-777b-39c2-b26e-3ef5d2e519ea",
                        "entry_id": "27a957a6-b230-3b8a-b39c-ad4e029ca073",
                        "glosses": [
                            "製片人"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f9d124b0-4a12-47bc-a7fb-0b62e27946de",
                                "sense_id": "688a644e-777b-39c2-b26e-3ef5d2e519ea",
                                "text": "I spent a couple of months all by myself building a set and had my filmmaker friends, nonactors, play the parts.",
                                "translation": "我花了几个月的时间独自搭建布景，并让我的制片人朋友（非演员）扮演这些角色。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c4335e11-e0de-4193-a488-9a2e22112c75",
                                "sense_id": "688a644e-777b-39c2-b26e-3ef5d2e519ea",
                                "text": "Such prissy mollycoddlings of audience expectations were shortly to come under heavyweight siege from a variety of filmmakers in the 1950s – not least the aforementioned Otto Preminger.",
                                "translation": "这种对观众期望的过分迎合很快就遭到了20世纪50年代各种制片人的强烈抨击，尤其是前面提到的奥托·普雷明格。"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
